  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the onion (see Make it faster). Peel the zucchini into ribbons with a vegetable peeler. Pick the parsley leaves, discarding the stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218307/photos/large/108514_1-a9dc7827daa15de28895879355b7f5ec.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make pizza sauce: Combine the Tuscan seasoning, tomato paste and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218310/photos/large/108514_2-dbe3821d0ffa3a34098998f84bf94e71.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Put 2 pita on the lined tray. Spread with the pizza sauce, then top with the vegan cheddar, zucchini and almonds. Bake the pizzas for 10-12 mins until the bases are golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218314/photos/large/108514_3-4b68351a5ae4ae4f823d4337b272907c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramelise onion: Meanwhile, heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over medium heat. Cook the onion, stirring, for 5 mins or until soft. Add 1 tbs balsamic vinegar and 1 tbs sugar and cook, stirring, for a further 5 mins or until caramelised. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218317/photos/large/108514_4-0997eeae77951027704351910b6d483f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Top the pizzas with the caramelised onion and scatter over the parsley leaves. Cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218320/photos/large/108514_5-148e65e929344c2724f21443a1b74967.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it faster: If you're short on time, skip caramelising the onion. Instead, scatter the onion over the pizzas before baking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218322/photos/large/108514_6-cefd2d9000780383dd23c9afd6b5f3ba.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
